  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:veattah_hashevota_lo">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:veattah_hashevota_lo/1"/>And You responded to him
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:veattah_hashevota_lo/2"/>in your manner of goodness
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:veattah_hashevota_lo/3"/>and You spoke and said to him,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:veattah_hashevota_lo/4"/>“I forgive [them] as you ask.”
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:veattah_hashevota_lo/5"/>We are ashamed of our actions
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:veattah_hashevota_lo/6"/>and we are disgraced with our sins
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:veattah_hashevota_lo/7"/>and our faces are blackened
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:veattah_hashevota_lo/8"/>from our sins.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:veattah_hashevota_lo/9"/>Our statures are bent
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:veattah_hashevota_lo/10"/>because of our guilt
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:veattah_hashevota_lo/11"/>and we have no excuse to offer
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:veattah_hashevota_lo/12"/>nor audacity to raise our heads.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
  </tei:text>
